{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30841","headline":"寄广州杨参军 · 马戴","name":"寄广州杨参军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南方春景好，念子缓归心。\n身方脱野服，冠未系朝簪。\n足恣平生赏，无虞外役侵。\n汀洲观鸟戏，向月和猨吟。\n税驾楚山广，扬帆湘水深。\n采奇搜石穴，怀胜即枫林。\n怅望极霞际，流情堕海阴。\n前朝杳难问，叹息洒鸣琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30841.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30841","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}